# Workflows that publish an image from a branch push / dispatch / schedule / PR (KC-46-02). Reported, not failed, until
# the release process moves to tags (needs the user: it changes how every team ships). Format: path  reason
.github/workflows/openmrs-build.yml  publishes on push (branches)
